A||N||3||Elenor84||Installing automatic door locks/windows||||1||
Z||000000||Elenor84||01-17-2001||02:23 AM||||Hey guys, I am planning on selling my car in summer but I've been looking at a bunch that are for sale and there for about 3 thousand and thas what I want to sell my car for but it is like the lowest model...no power door locks cruse windows steering...nothing...so what I wanted to do was install power door locks...that would at least make it look a bit better..and if possible windows...I own a 84 2m4...what do I have to do to makke it happen?  Thx!<P>------------------<BR>Lance||||reg||1
Z||000001||Carrolles||01-17-2001||08:33 AM||||Installing power windows and door locks is not an afternoon project.  It is pretty involved.  You can either get a set of doors that have the options along with the wiring harness out of a donor car or try and get all the pieces individually.<P>The pdl and pw parts are riveted into the door structure.  You can drill out the rivets and either rivet the new parts in  (it takes 1/4" rivets) or use bolts/nuts with locktite.<P>It's not necessarily a difficult job but it is involved.  I don't think it would be worth the effort just to sell the car.  <P>I plan to do this to my 85se and have had the parts for almost two years.  My job travels have not co-operated with the project schedule.  I got two donor doors at Ed Parks' swap meet for about $40 total and I got the wiring harness from a wrecking yard for $15.00.<P>Good luck,<P>Carroll<p>[This message has been edited by Carrolles (edited 01-17-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||rogergarrison||01-17-2001||04:59 PM||||if your planning on selling it, dont spend any money on things like that, they wont get you any more. Nice paint or tires would be about the only thing worthwhile, or maybe seat upholstery if it needs it.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Tigger||01-17-2001||05:37 PM||||I have to agree too.<P>Save the pwr goodies for a Fiero you intend on keeping.  Not very many stock 2m4's and even SE's sell for more than 2k unless they are in excellent shape and very low mileage.  Although the power options will no doubt help it sell, I doubt adding that alone will bring 3k for it.<P>||||reg||1
